    <div class="n-price-card"><h3>Starter</h3><div class="n-price">$29</div><p>1 Domain · 12 Months</p><ul><li>24+ Features</li><li>1 Domain License</li><li>Email Support</li></ul><a href="` + startUrl + `" class="n-btn n-btn-primary n-btn-block" ` + startAttr + `>Get Started</a></div>
